# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Generated Reports & Documents
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Root-anchored: `docs/reports/` is tracked documentation, so a bare
# `reports/` pattern would silently swallow any new file added there.
/reports/
output/
generated/
downloads/
exports/
*.pdf
!app/**/templates/**/*.html  # Keep template files
*.xlsx
!app/**/*.py  # Keep Python files
*.zip
*.tar
*.tar.gz
*.tgz
*.gz

